Database plan
Start with only these tables:
Table ->	Purpose
profiles,	Minimal app profile tied to the authenticated user
token_ledger,	Every award or purchase, rather than only a changing balance
store_items,	Items students can purchase
user_inventory,	Items a student owns and whether one is selected
canvas_connections,	Canvas user ID and secure connection metadata


The important design choice is the token_ledger: never just overwrite a token balance. Record entries such as +10 early submission or -25 purchased midnight theme, then calculate the balance from the entries. It gives you an audit trail and makes bugs much easier to fix.
Enable Row Level Security on every user-data table so students can access only their own records. Supabase documents RLS as the database-level control for limiting data by user, and recommends protecting public user tables with it.